      "id": 764336,
      "category": "team",
      "content": "Reporter 4x4 discovered a race condition vulnerability in backend.singlestore.com that allowed free-tier users to bypass the 5-workspace limit by sending multiple simultaneous CreateWorkspace requests, enabling unlimited workspace creation and potential resource abuse. This issue has since been patched by SingleStore as of October 3rd, 2025.",
